dnwqyLmK2-tv3e60CaZ5zdtQHI9dpRcik0tuSZaWeCLVt8FzmcRs_5Br9qBTlWHcjM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw3UBR12aYuPFeiMnngOKNoLAcRa8wjFXXUNDmcqY-GGQ&oe=69AC32B7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mOkg3ga4D7oQ7kNvwGjUK3s&_nc_oc=AdkfYbL_DoOdwuzkxFsBYfbt0DvN6ykTxQrZDLNLqpxUMtT8Cr1TpPran9qlcJSSmJY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afyzm1pM9mTiWFp_Car2gD20WMlnYXIl1ElDIX5l6A6rSw&oe=69AC344A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sdZ8v2dFnKYQ7kNvwHDHKcT&_nc_oc=AdkBM9NQ0dnUtHAswGZ8m7rtB4ff6S1ZUjHtbj_PIqlpWxYg_yOijOG0SLvXDTlUT04&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzdThaZx644r7ABoXJOI3r84_G9tGf0KBRE9GphsHuo5g&oe=69AC216F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hU9bRK2q_LcQ7kNvwGhBaNz&_nc_oc=AdnbieSaG6-Kys8vO6cpT6ZhrggBjYjPwQNWOvYpJi42CppeAybF8rmSfHccK2V9vPk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx4IO355K5ZLG1ffdGT1y8iPLhUFi5a9wW-oG5TAjwAhA&oe=69AC0AC3"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V7jrplLmmKsQ7kNvwGXv9yp&_nc_oc=Adm_wCGqmZ3uP--MredUxeLGfHOalrTdxSdYSp6wYi3r6jF8saUyiOyMdwBCSatIw64&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyxKUwsjY8Sq7sPoTVisJsg6PPXI_RjFCc6fqKFnCtSfQ&oe=69AC0318"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7xbrxRs_CDEQ7kNvwEnFh_P&_nc_oc=Adle-Jg8zh1TkJoRJsDB7g-emyCYjh1x1AQ3KkgFCCNhZkfJp6CsCcZ02Rh4-uUikYQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfygtwI0j2aLqjh8Ctg30Ik-Urgj9iBMuXR1ULGpwARwHA&oe=69AC163C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_6208099537495751086_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&