2131092734129191", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622166_2131092737462524_8680641054341149174_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JiFgqYETKw0Q7kNvwGzrM2V&_nc_oc=AdnwqyLmK2-tv3e60CaZ5zdtQHI9dpRcik0tuSZaWeCLVt8FzmcRs_5Br9qBTlWHcjM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw3UBR12aYuPFeiMnngOKNoLAcRa8wjFXXUNDmcqY-GGQ&oe=69AC32B7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mOkg3ga4D7oQ7kNvwGjUK3s&_nc_oc=AdkfYbL_DoOdwuzkxFsBYfbt0DvN6ykTxQrZDLNLqpxUMtT8Cr1TpPran9qlcJSSmJY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afyzm1pM9mTiWFp_Car2gD20WMlnYXIl1ElDIX5l6A6rSw&oe=69AC344A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sdZ8v2dFnKYQ7kNvwHDHKcT&_nc_oc=AdkBM9NQ0dnUtHAswGZ8m7rtB4ff6S1ZUjHtbj_PIqlpWxYg_yOijOG0SLvXDTlUT04&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzdThaZx644r7ABoXJOI3r84_G9tGf0KBRE9GphsHuo5g&oe=69AC216F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current 